{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"前一段安静、克制的亲近在这里变得更饱满、更热切，投入明显加深；但这不是重新开始迫切索求，而是在明知这份满足有限之后，仍然愿意更充分地承受它、享受它。尚未安顿的部分没有消失，所以这种热切里仍带着不能完全落定的张力。\",\"thread\":\"上一段已经让人能够把两件事分开：这份满足不能解决全部需要，却仍然真实而值得接受。正因为不再要求它承担“必须让我彻底满足”的任务，此刻反而可以更毫无保留地投入其中；投入得更深，并不等于又相信“再多一点就能解决一切”。于是同一种亲近可以比刚才更强烈，同时仍容纳那个没有被解决的部分。\",\"used\":\"第5段已经显出继续加深同一种满足不能直接处理剩下的需要；第6段进一步确立，有限的满足可以不以解决全部需要来衡量，并且能与尚未安顿的需要同时存在。\",\"new\":[\"强烈地投入一份满足，不再必然意味着向它索取全部答案；人在知道它有限之后，仍然可以让它充分地成为满足。\",\"原先只有在克制中才能共存的“真实满足”和“仍未安顿”，现在即使投入加深，也不必重新混成一个要求。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "abf6da30-296f-45fa-93ea-c2af22a3666d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T220217261141Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.922, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:02:52.189879+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ffce711977710e3144347ddbf08665942748ad765773635238c17f0d2da70b75", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f68